  "bodyHash": "ZFnkeQ5eKR0=",
  "content": "<h5>不完整的模組，為 Minecraft 添加復古血腥效果與戰鬥改進，靈感來自復古射擊遊戲。內含配置文件。</h5><h5>2025年9月21日。未更新，但處於穩定開發中。對開發過程中的模糊訊息深感抱歉。</h5><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/cxDpn60prgc\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><h5>特色：</h5><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li>多種顏色的血腥粒子，</li>\n<li>血腥音效</li>\n<li>肢解實體</li>\n<li>0.5 Beta 版中的屍體（尚未可用）</li>\n<li>0.5 Beta 版中帶有血腥特效的武器（尚未可用）</li>\n<li>ᓭᒷᓵ∷ᒷℸ ̣ &nbsp;ᒷ ̇/ℸ ̣ ∷ᔑ ↸╎ᒲᒷリᓭ╎𝙹リᓭ（尚未可用）</li>\n</ul>\n</div><h5>製作人員：</h5><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffreesound.org%252fpeople%252fFoolBoyMedia%252fpacks%252f14592%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FoolBoyMedia</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffreesound.org%252fpeople%252fUOregonCinemaStudies%252fsounds%252f418776%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">UOregonCinemaStudies</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffreesound.org%252fpeople%252feddybennet%252fsounds%252f226381%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">eddybennet</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffreesound.org%252fpeople%252fmagnuswaker%252fpacks%252f29802%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">magnuswaker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffreesound.org%252fpeople%252fCGEffex%252fsounds%252f93839%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CGEEffex</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffreesound.org%252fpeople%252fnewlocknew%252fsounds%252f784955%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">newlocknew</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffreesound.org%252fpeople%252fbusabx%252fsounds%252f736977%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">busabx</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffreesound.org%252fpeople%252fadriancalzon%252fsounds%252f220619%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">adriancalzon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffreesound.org%252fpeople%252fklankbeeld%252fsounds%252f829150%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">klankbeeld</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h5>適用於舊版 Minecraft？</h5><div class=\"spoiler\">我無法將模組移植到較舊版本，因為 MCreator 的插件與功能在舊版 MCreator 中不存在。每個版本的 MCreator 對應不同版本的 Minecraft，目前我的 MCreator 版本是 2024.2（支援 1.20.1 Forge + 1.20.6 NeoForge）。</div><h5><span style=\"color:#c30000\">建議用於優化的模組：&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#c30000\"><a style=\"color:#c30000\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/particle-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/particle-core</a></span></h5><h5><span style=\"color:#c30000\">Gore Edition TZP 部分相容性擴充套件（由 That1LilGuy 製作）：</span><span style=\"color:#c30000\"><a style=\"color:#c30000\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/gore-edition-tzp-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/gore-edition-tzp-compatibility</a></span></h5><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1172/619/2025-04-29_15-10-01-min-png.png\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zTqZl2k.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"430\" height=\"128\"></p><p>從 0.5 alpha 0.4 版本開始，授權條款為「保留所有權利」。舊版本的授權則以壓縮檔內的授權為準。</p><p>你可以基於此模組製作衍生作品：材質包、擴充套件、相容性模組或修補程式。因為我希望專注於開發工作，例如音效、肢解實體、屍體、粒子效果、武器、設定檔以及錯誤修復。</p>",
